      "prompt": "From Level 85: no one has ever seen dark matter. What evidence convinced astronomers it exists?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "label": "Photos of dark clouds between galaxies",
          "correct": false,
          "rationale": "Dark matter is invisible, not dark-colored."
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "label": "Samples returned by space probes",
          "correct": false,
          "rationale": "No probe has collected any."
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "label": "Radio signals from dark matter itself",
          "correct": false,
